A marker under a quoted description paragraph in an item is text

```
- > :: t
  > : d
  > - z
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote>
      <dl>
        <dt>t</dt>
        <dd>d
- z</dd>
      </dl>
    </blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
> :: t
> : d
> - z
.
<blockquote>
  <dl>
    <dt>t</dt>
    <dd>d
- z</dd>
  </dl>
</blockquote>
```
